  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.1-preview.27\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.27 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.26\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.26 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.25\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.25 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.24\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.24 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.23\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.23 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.22\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.22 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.21\n- No functional changes; synchronized with the framework-free MAUI integration sweep.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.20\n- Initial release of the Messaging Apple integration package (iOS, macOS, Mac Catalyst).\n- Implements all four platform contracts (IMessagingRegistrar, IMessagingEventSource, IMessagingPermissionManager, IMessagingTopicSubscriber) over public HTTPS (fcmregistrations.googleapis.com) with APNs handling delivery. No third-party Firebase bindings.\n- Uses IFirebaseInstallations FID + FIS token as the single registration identity.",
